  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing a reporting approach for emission impact of climate finance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The agreement is between the Norwegian Agency for Development Cooperation (Norad) and the Organisation for Economic Co-operation and Development (OECD). It outlines the terms and procedures for Norad&apos;s financial support to a specific project within the OECD Programme of Work and Budget. The project&apos;s aim is to develop a common reporting approach for emission impacts of international climate mitigation finance.</narrative>
  </description>
